 docs/GOAL3_COMMAND_AUDIT.jsonl         | 652 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 docs/GOAL3_COMMAND_AUDIT_EXCEPTIONS.md |   2 +-
 docs/GOAL3_STATUS.md                   |  23 +-
 docs/STATUS.md                         |  26 +-
